  "description": "Team Leader Lee Do-hyun of the Future Strategy Planning Team runs his team with an overbearing, self-centered style. For the sake of promotion, he even betrayed a close colleague from his early days, earning himself the title of the company’s most disliked person. On the night of a welcome party, he is forced into a sexual encounter with the new hire, Kang Joo-hyuk. Tormented by Joo-hyuk’s persistent harassment even at work, the truth of what happened at the party spreads through the office. In the end, the entire team unites to bully Do-hyun.\n\n*“So then, Team Leader, please approve this.”*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/plz_4), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/please_approve_it), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000065261), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12791977), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1539013649), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250285) \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.wecomics.in.th/comics/18816)",
